       the whole widget (≥44px tall) → the one-line reveals. */
    .pk-bbar { position: relative; margin: 0.55rem 0 0.45rem;
      --ramp: linear-gradient(90deg, #8a8a96, #b08a4a, #d9c25a, #7cc465, #35d97a); }
